#: 08c86bb453704d82b01a91b69fd157ef
msgid "1. Collect with VR teleop"
msgstr "1. 用 VR 遥操作采集"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/3-vla_collect_train_deploy.md:7
#: d9c0c06b0c64465cb2d5843ca9b14f2e
msgid ""
"Bring up the robot (mock, sim, or real) from [Go to Real "
"Hardware](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/0-index.md) or [Run"
" Mock Demo](../2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md)."
msgstr ""
"从[部署到真实机器人](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/0-index.md)或[运行 Mock "
"演示](../2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md)拉起机器人（mock、仿真或真机）。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/3-vla_collect_train_deploy.md:8
#: 2dd89dcdeff54b8d9bb105f111d51537
msgid ""
