"[VR 遥操作](../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md) — 在 [fa-py-"
"libraries](../4-reference/python_apps/2-fa_py_libraries.md) 中执行 `./run.sh vr` "
"或 `./run.sh vr-xrt`。"

